*OpenUI *LBPHalftone/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *LBPHalftone
*DefaultLBPHalftone: ErrorDiffusion
*LBPHalftone ErrorDiffusion/Smooth (error diffusion): ""
*LBPHalftone Ordered/Pattern (ordered dither): ""
*LBPHalftone Threshold/Text only (no greys): ""
